        "Rechecked 2026-10-12: the Logan County elections page still links the same 12 sample ballot styles (001-02 through 009-03) and no TABOR notice or participating-entities list. All 12 were re-read from their searchable text; none contains the words Crook, Iliff, Merino or Peetz, and their local content is unchanged (City of Sterling 2A, Buffalo School District RE-4J 5A, Town of Fleming offices).",
